n":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117018","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117018","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117018.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117018.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-21T21:48:32Z"},"body":"Before, debug builds lacked assertions, but they were added to release template. So I moved assertions to debug and also made debug symbols include `--profiling-funcs` so they could be included in release template if needed.\r\n\r\nHere is before with changes in context\r\n<img width=\"1406\" height=\"400\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fe832bc9-d300-4e3f-93e4-7bb8821c924f\" />\r\nAnd after\r\n```python\r\n    if env.debug_features:\r\n        env[\"use_assertions\"] = True\r\n    if env[\"debug_symbols\"]:\r\n        # Retain function names for backtraces at the cost of file size.\r\n        env.Append(LINKFLAGS=[\"--profiling-funcs\"])\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api